{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>「Dinner Light」是一款專為餐廳場景設計的實用工具，結合可調亮度電筒、即時菜單放大鏡、小費計算與帳單分帳功能，適合在昏暗環境下閱讀菜單、計算小費或平分帳單的用家。目前正限時免費，原價 US $2.99。</p>\n\n<h2>餐桌照明與帳單工具</h2>\n<p>電筒亮度可從微光順暢調至全亮，當 App 移至背景時會自動關閉。即時後置鏡頭放大鏡能協助閱讀細小文字，而且不會記錄或儲存任何影像。小費計算支援 12% 至 22% 預設與自訂百分比，可選擇按稅前或總額計算，並可平分帳單、顯示每人應付金額，亦可將金額湊整，差額加入服務費。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-392-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-393-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-394-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-395-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-396-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Dinner Light</li>\n<li>應用類別：Food &amp; Drink</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-11T23:19:48.740640+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":303,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}